message: "If you use this software or its data, please cite the article below."
title: 'Replication package for "Modeling and Evaluating Collaboration Dynamics in LLM-Based Multi-Agent Systems for Automated Software Architecture Design"'
type: software
abstract: >-
  Code, prompts, system briefs, ATAM scenarios and experimental configurations of the study, the raw outputs
  of all runs (discussion transcripts, analysis reports, YAML models and PlantUML diagrams), the evaluation
  scores with the judge's justifications, and the analysis scripts. The code is released under the MIT
  License; the data in results/ under CC BY 4.0.
